"""Whisper small push-to-talk for the Steam Frame.

A short click of the headset Select button is left for Steam Input.
Hold it until the beep, then speak, then release. The words are typed
into whatever gamescope has focused. The mic on a floating window
starts immediately and types into that window. Controller buttons are
not triggers.

"clear" and "submit" are actions when they are the whole transcript or
the first or last word. Clear backspaces the characters whisper typed.
Submit presses Enter. The same word in the middle is typed.

Config: ~/.config/whisper-ptt/config
"""

